# Server-only secrets — store in Supabase Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets
# (and/or EAS Secrets for build-time needs). Never commit values.
#
# Required by Edge Functions (send-push, delete-account):
#   SERVICE_ROLE_KEY          (or SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY)
#   SUPABASE_URL              (usually auto-injected)
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY         (usually auto-injected)
#   FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID
#   FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL
#   FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY
#
# Optional (bot / ops — NOT used by Expo client):
#   TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
#   ADMIN_CHAT_ID
#
# Database trigger vault (pg_net → send-push):
#   vault secret name: service_role_key
#
# After removing these from git history / local .env, rotate each key
# that was ever committed. See security hardening report.
